    "updated_at": "2025-09-06T17:50:03Z",
    "body": "Hi all,\n\nI ran a quick recursive search in the live source/ folder of my fork to check for any remaining stray patterns:\n\nbash\ngrep -R -n \"Record{\" source/\ngrep -R -n \"Completion Record\" source/\ngrep -R -n \"Record {\" source/\n\nAll searches returned no results, which indicates that the spacing and <span data-x=\"…\"> links for “Completion Record” and related terms are already in place in the spec. Unless there are other patterns I’ve overlooked, I recommend closing this issue as already implemented. Please let me know if there’s anything else to verify!\n\nThanks, Mahesh Bainoor",
